# WLISTTQ.KEY - the growing range of a list that is not counted (O: the
# list opened again without WL_EXACT), the count carried to a list opened
# again (C) and the count of a list opened again with WL_EXACT (SHIFT-O),
# over the eleven rows of WLLONG.REQ; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WLISTTQ.SNP.
S START
K O
S GROW
K N
S GROWPG
K N
S GROWPG2
# C with no count: the list opened again counts by a survey.
K C
S CARRY0
K 6
S CARRYJ
K O
S GROW2
# The End move ends the list: its rows are known and stay known, the
# range and the count kept as the window goes back up.
K B
S GROWEND
K P
S GROWUP
K P P
S GROWUP2
K T
S GROWTOP
# The owner's count changes adjust the known count.
K A
S GROWADD
K SHIFT-A
S GROWSUB
# A thumb jump steps by pages; at the range's top it is the End move.
K 2
S GROWJUMP
K 1
S GROWJMP1
K 9
S GROWBOT
# A new order forgets the count: the growing range again.
K TAB
S GROWTAB
K TAB
S GROWID
# C with the count known by the End move: no survey; a jump steps.
K B
K C
S CARRY
K 5
S CARRYJ5
K 9
S CARRYEND
# SHIFT-O: counted again.
K SHIFT-O
S EXACT
K 4
S EXACTJ
